flowchart TD
  T[Text too large] --> Sep{Try separator}
  Sep -->|section blank lines| P1[Split sections]
  Sep -->|paragraphs| P2[Split paragraphs]
  Sep -->|sentences| P3[Split sentences]
  Sep -->|words / hard cut| P4[Hard windows]
  P1 --> Fit{Fits chunk_size?}
  P2 --> Fit
  P3 --> Fit
  P4 --> Fit
  Fit -->|yes| Out[Emit chunk]
  Fit -->|no| Sep
